-- Typical Pipe Support R1: independent review candidate.
-- Select a writable SITE before loading. No delete or save commands.
-- Source identification is provisional; see the review report.
-- All new details are Reference Values, not a fabrication design.
NEW ZONE /ZONE_TYPICAL_SUPPORT_R1
ORI Y IS N AND Z IS U
POS E 0 N 0 U 0
NEW STRU /TPS_R1_STRUCTURE
ORI Y IS N AND Z IS U
POS E 0 N 0 U 0
NEW FRMW /TPS_R1_FRAME
NEW SCTN /TPS_R1_BEAM
POSS E 0.0 N 16.0 U 0.0
POSE E 0.0 N 1500.0 U 0.0
DRNS PERP
DRNE PERP
JUSL CTOP
SPRE SPCOMPONENT /BS-PFC150x75x18
END
NEW SCTN /TPS_R1_BRACE
POSS E 0.0 N 16.0 U -470.0
POSE E 0.0 N 1055.0 U -185.0
DRNS PERP
DRNE PERP
JUSL TOAY
SPRE SPCOMPONENT /BS-L50x50x6
END
/ZONE_TYPICAL_SUPPORT_R1
NEW EQUI /TPS_R1_HARDWARE
POS E 0.0 N 0.0 U 0.0
